owing functions. asIndexedPairs is absent because not in Node22. Inherited copies of these deferred methods on Duplex remain deferred.", "encodingNames": ["utf8", "utf-8", "hex"], "limits": {"maxQueuedNonObjectUnits": 16777216, "maxQueuedChunks": 4096, "maxObjectModeUnits": 4096, "maxBufferBytes": 16777216, "maxInputStringCodeUnits": 1048576}, "deviations": ["No native component gate yet; host reference scheduling is not the guest scheduler.", "Byte inputs are ordinary attached fixed unshared ArrayBufferViews; raw byte windows preserve offset/backing, not element truncation. Shared/resizable/detached/proxy/exotic state domains are not claimed.", "Default byte HWM is deterministically65536 and object HWM16. HWM remains a threshold, not a memory bound.", "Queue budget units match Node state.length: bytes before decoding or UTF16 code units after decoding. Object/chunk counts do not bound arbitrary application payload or total memory. Discard a stream after its profile limit failure; full atomic rollback is not claimed.", "Only existing bounded Buffer/StringDecoder encodings and errors apply; no Buffer pool, copy/concat/write/numeric API expansion.", "Web overloads, function pipeline stages, pair/compose/operators/disposal/legacy module aliases remain deferred. This candidate does not register consumers or stream/web.", "Registration getter/return-then-getter/Symbol.dispose identity and scheduler/reset/ALS/request teardown limitations remain independent. captureRejections:true remains explicitly unavailable through the installed Events foundation.", "Public own-state mutation, arbitrary primordial mutation, full exact own-property reflection/error text/stack/cross-realm and async_hooks parity are not claimed."]}, "node:stream/promises": {"aliases": ["stream/promises"], "status": "partial", "exports": ["default", "finished", "pipeline"], "supportedStatic": ["finished", "pipeline"], "callablePolicy": "Promise wrappers over the same bounded classic lifecycle. Native Web/f