orted inspect. Supported validation errors preserve tested TypeError/code, not exact Node diagnostic text.", "deviations": ["Not complete util support.41 util callable bindings are deferred; their declared names/default relationships remain intact.", "TextEncoder/TextDecoder are exact installed Web constructors; existing codec encoding/coercion/resource limits remain, including encodeInto nonstring coercion deviation.", "promisify supports ordinary err-first and publiccustom symbol shapes. Node internal customArgs annotations and DEP0174/process warning emission are excluded; Promise-returning originals retain callback settlement behavior without that warning.", "Function error text/stack, metadata arity and constructibility outside tested supported/deferred shapes are not fully Node-equivalent. Runtime require and syncBuiltinESMExports are excluded.", "No process/env/stdio/clock/entropy/filesystem capability is introduced. Warning delivery, inspect rendering/format, callbackify nextTick, native callsites/errno and transfer hooks remain deferred.", "Sys shares util default/named values but has a distinct module namespace. DEP0025 warning delivery is deliberately omitted to avoid implicit capabilities; this is partial compatibility."]}, "node:util/types": {"aliases": ["util/types"], "status": "partial", "exports": ["default", "isAnyArrayBuffer", "isArgumentsObject", "isArrayBuffer", "isArrayBufferView", "isAsyncFunction", "isBigInt64Array", "isBigIntObject", "isBigUint64Array", "isBooleanObject", "isBoxedPrimitive", "isCryptoKey", "isDataView", "isDate", "isExternal", "isFloat32Array", "isFloat64Array", "isGeneratorFunction", "isGeneratorObject", "isInt16Array", "isInt32Array", "isInt8Array", "isKeyObject", "isMap", "isMapIterator", "isModuleNamespaceObject", "isNativeError", "isNumberObject", "isPromise", "isProxy", "isRegExp", "isSet", "isSetIterator", "isSharedArrayBuffer", "isStringObject", "isSymbolObject", "isTypedArray", "isUint16Array", "isUint32Array", "isUi